Using {\bf Proposition \ref{Property-P}}-$(i)$, the following upper bound estimate holds
	\begin{align*}
		\left\langle \big(E''(\phi_g)-\lambda_g\big)d_n,d_n\right\rangle\le L\|d_n\|^2_{\mathcal{P}_{\phi_g}}.
	\end{align*}
